internal/rtprof contains code adapted from the Go runtime/pprof package
(BSD-3-Clause, Copyright The Go Authors): elf.go is copied, and the location
building in symbols.go (inline-frame grouping, /proc/self/maps parsing) and
scaleHeapSample in profiler.go follow runtime/pprof. elf.go and symbols.go
keep the Go copyright header; scaleHeapSample is marked in place.

