It depends on, and does not copy code from:
- go.opentelemetry.io/otel and go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk (Apache-2.0).
- github.com/klauspost/compress (BSD-3-Clause / Apache-2.0 / MIT parts).
- google.golang.org/protobuf (BSD-3-Clause), protowire only.

The public API shape follows github.com/grafana/pyroscope-go (Apache-2.0)
and the span-label idea follows github.com/grafana/otel-profiling-go
(Apache-2.0); both were used as design references only. Tests use
github.com/google/pprof (Apache-2.0), the generated OTLP protos
(Apache-2.0) and github.com/open-telemetry/sig-profiling/profcheck
(Apache-2.0); the benchmark demo links github.com/grafana/pyroscope-go
(Apache-2.0) and the separate test/godeltaprof module links
github.com/grafana/pyroscope-go/godeltaprof (Apache-2.0), both for
comparison only.
